OL,3,GNEWSARapist taxi driver's appeal
OL,4,Aagainst conviction and sentence refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi driver who was convicted of
OL,7,Fraping an 18-year-old female passenger
OL,8,Fin the Highlands has had his appeal to
OL,9,Fboth his conviction and sentence
OL,10,Frefused.
OL,12,FDavid Brown was jailed for almost seven
OL,13,Fyears in May for the attack in December
OL,14,F2023.
OL,16,FHe picked up the woman, who had been on
OL,17,Fa night out in Inverness, and drove
OL,18,Fpast her destination before attacking
OL,19,Fher in a lay-by.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
