OL,3,GNEWSARapist taxi driver's appeal
OL,4,Aagainst conviction and sentence refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, Highland
OL,7,Fcouncillors overwhelmingly delivered a
OL,8,Fvote of no confidence in five
OL,9,Fcouncillors who allowed Brown to keep
OL,10,Ftwo taxi operator licences following
OL,11,Fhis conviction.
